 "insight": [
  "The share of Luxembourg's exports going to the United Kingdom decreased from 8.6% in 2005 to 2.2% in 2025.",
  "The largest share was 9.3% in 2010, and the median share over 2005 to 2025 was 3.9%.",
  "The biggest drop between consecutive years was from 5.4% in 2012 to 2.8% in 2013.",
  "The share in 2024 was 2.3%, very close to the 2025 figure.",
  "These values are in current euros and are not adjusted for price changes, which may affect comparisons over time."
 ],
